  "ruleText": "Section Saf-C 3122.02 Disabled Students Who Need Special Behind-the-Wheel Instruction.\n\nThese changes necessitated the renumbering of many rules within Chapter Saf-C 3100. The source note information for the rules under these new numbers contains the document numbers and effective dates for the rules under the former numbers, which are identified in the source notes. The source note information for the new definition Saf-C 3102.05 refers only to Document #12509 since this rule did not exist prior to Document #12509.",
